# Ejecutar en orden sobre una demo recién cargada.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@userId = 1
@limitOrderId = 13

### 1. Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Portfolio inicial
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/portfolio

### 3. Buscar PAMP por ticker y nombre
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?ticker=pamp&name=holding

### 4. Comprar dos PAMP a mercado
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 2
}

### 5. Comprar PAMP por monto con límite
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "amount": "2150.00",
  "price": "1000.00"
}

### 6. Portfolio con la reserva
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/portfolio

### 7. Vender una BMA sin tenencia suficiente
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 31,
  "side": "SELL",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 1
}

### 8. Cancelar la compra pendiente del paso 5
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders/{{limitOrderId}}/cancel

### 9. Portfolio final
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/portfolio
